  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThis is a recipe for portrait photography. It has no strong characteristics and is versatile enough to be used outdoors in any environment, creating an atmosphere of warm colors. The overall contrast is kept low, since it is also intended for use in video. To tighten up the atmosphere in the video, record in 10-bit to take advantage of its richer gradation and increase the contrast with editing software.",
